    {
      "subId": "1402206",
      "subQuestName": "离开厄舍的工厂",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1402207",
      "subQuestName": "离开厄舍的工厂",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "140220701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "140220701": {
            "id": "140220701",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "…总算回到出口了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220702"
            ]
          },
          "140220702": {
            "id": "140220702",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "厄舍",
            "text": "…哦？真是意外。连下面的房间都困不住你们。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220703"
            ]
          },
          "140220703": {
            "id": "140220703",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "厄舍！你逃不掉了！我们已经掌握了你工厂的犯罪证据！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220704"
            ]
          },
          "140220704": {
            "id": "140220704",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "厄舍",
            "text": "你又凭什么觉得，我会让证据离开这个工厂呢？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220705"
            ]
          },
          "140220705": {
            "id": "140220705",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "又是机械警卫…你有完没完？拿这些钱去干点正事不好吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220706"
            ]
          },
          "140220706": {
            "id": "140220706",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "厄舍",
            "text": "这就是我的正事。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220707"
            ]
          },
          "140220707": {
            "id": "140220707",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "搞垮「千织屋」？还是做你的臭衣服？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220708"
            ]
          },
          "140220708": {
            "id": "140220708",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "厄舍",
            "text": "是去证明「时尚」仅仅为一场可笑的闹剧，一场无知的狂欢！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220709"
            ]
          },
          "140220709": {
            "id": "140220709",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "…你被「时尚」这个概念套住了，厄舍。别去迎合它，做自己的东西，去改变它。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220710"
            ]
          },
          "140220710": {
            "id": "140220710",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "厄舍",
            "text": "别在这对我说教！你早晚也会有一天对「时尚」低头，它说到底就只是一种舆论而已！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220711"
            ]
          },
          "140220711": {
            "id": "140220711",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "它是人们对一种理念的向往。而「千织屋」的理念，就是绝不低头…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220712"
            ]
          },
          "140220712": {
            "id": "140220712",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "厄舍",
            "text": "哼，当人们看到时尚界推崇的「千织屋」一落千丈的时候，他们就会知道这理念有多可笑。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220713"
            ]
          },
          "140220713": {
            "id": "140220713",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "你就为了证明自己这个无聊的念头，才对我的品牌下手？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220715"
            ]
          },
          "140220715": {
            "id": "140220715",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "…以前的你可不是这样的，那个想做出震撼人心作品的厄舍去哪儿了？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220716"
            ]
          },
          "140220716": {
            "id": "140220716",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "厄舍",
            "text": "我只是意识到那种不切实际的梦想有多么荒唐！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220717"
            ]
          },
          "140220717": {
            "id": "140220717",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "…你放弃了自己的梦想，现在又转过头来贬低它。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220718"
            ]
          },
          "140220718": {
            "id": "140220718",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "你自以为看清了一切，但…你不过是想证明自己放弃的那条路是错的，才能心安理得地过下去罢了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220719"
            ]
          },
          "140220719": {
            "id": "140220719",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "我就直说了吧，你这样子很可悲。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220720"
            ]
          },
          "140220720": {
            "id": "140220720",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "厄舍",
            "text": "可悲的是你。像个傻子一样做着什么「风靡提瓦特」的白日梦，我看你连枫丹都要待不下去了！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220721"
            ]
          },
          "140220721": {
            "id": "140220721",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "……",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220722"
            ]
          },
          "140220722": {
            "id": "140220722",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "…你说得对，或许所有追逐梦想的人都是傻子。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220723"
            ]
          },
          "140220723": {
            "id": "140220723",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "但更可悲的，是那些连傻子都不敢做的懦夫…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220724"
            ]
          },
          "140220724": {
            "id": "140220724",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "厄舍",
            "text": "你…！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220727"
            ]
          },
          "140220727": {
            "id": "140220727",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "没错，这里交给我们！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220728"
            ]
          },
          "140220728": {
            "id": "140220728",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "不，应该是你们先走才对。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220729"
            ]
          },
          "140220729": {
            "id": "140220729",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "欸？可是…他还有枪…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220730"
            ]
          },
          "140220730": {
            "id": "140220730",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "没事的。你们去会场，告诉大家计划照常进行。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220731"
            ]
          },
          "140220731": {
            "id": "140220731",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "这里，必须由我「亲自」给他一个教训。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1402208",
      "subQuestName": "返回「千织屋」",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "140220801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "140220801": {
            "id": "140220801",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "娜维娅",
            "text": "…现在怎么样了？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220802"
            ]
          },
          "140220802": {
            "id": "140220802",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "再往左靠一点。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220803"
            ]
          },
          "140220803": {
            "id": "140220803",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "绮良良",
            "text": "…这样？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220804"
            ]
          },
          "140220804": {
            "id": "140220804",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "嗯，完美。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220805"
            ]
          },
          "140220805": {
            "id": "140220805",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "绮良良",
            "text": "嘿咻…！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220806"
            ]
          },
          "140220806": {
            "id": "140220806",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "夏洛蒂",
            "text": "哦！很合适呢！千织小姐，我能拍一张吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220807"
            ]
          },
          "140220807": {
            "id": "140220807",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "当然。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220808"
            ]
          },
          "140220808": {
            "id": "140220808",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "绮良良",
            "text": "我都不知道千织姐你还做了新招牌呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220809"
            ]
          },
          "140220809": {
            "id": "140220809",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "时装周前就做好了。想着等时装秀成功之后再挂上去。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220810"
            ]
          },
          "140220810": {
            "id": "140220810",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "娜维娅",
            "text": "想要风靡提瓦特，没有一个自己的招牌怎么行？在这一点上，「刺玫会」可比你领先哦！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220811"
            ]
          },
          "140220811": {
            "id": "140220811",
            "speakerId": 1010,
            "speakerName": "林尼",
            "text": "这么一想的话，我们魔术团队是不是也该考虑设计一个？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220812"
            ]
          },
          "140220812": {
            "id": "140220812",
            "speakerId": 1011,
            "speakerName": "琳妮特",
            "text": "哥哥和我的招牌图案，分别是「怪笑帽帽猫」和「惊奇猫猫盒」。还得把佩伊加进来。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220813"
            ]
          },
          "140220813": {
            "id": "140220813",
            "speakerId": 1010,
            "speakerName": "林尼",
            "text": "那佩伊就是…「不笑饿饿鹅」？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220814"
            ]
          },
          "140220814": {
            "id": "140220814",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "娜维娅",
            "text": "噗哈哈哈哈…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220815"
            ]
          },
          "140220815": {
            "id": "140220815",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "听起来是需要在帽子里塞两只猫和一只企鹅？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220816"
            ]
          },
          "140220816": {
            "id": "140220816",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "绮良良",
            "text": "哇，好像很暖和！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220817"
            ]
          },
          "140220817": {
            "id": "140220817",
            "speakerId": 1011,
            "speakerName": "琳妮特",
            "text": "画面好挤…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220818"
            ]
          },
          "140220818": {
            "id": "140220818",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "夏洛蒂",
            "text": "#千织小姐！我拍好了，连带着{NICKNAME}给我的那些证据，文章明天就能登上《蒸汽鸟报》。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220819"
            ]
          },
          "140220819": {
            "id": "140220819",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "谢谢你，夏洛蒂。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220820"
            ]
          },
          "140220820": {
            "id": "140220820",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "夏洛蒂",
            "text": "没事没事，将真相带给观众，是一位记者应该做的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220821"
            ]
          },
          "140220821": {
            "id": "140220821",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "以后「温亨廷先生」的装饰，我全都免费帮你定制。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220822"
            ]
          },
          "140220822": {
            "id": "140220822",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "夏洛蒂",
            "text": "欸欸欸！真…真的可以吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220823"
            ]
          },
          "140220823": {
            "id": "140220823",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "当然。林尼和琳妮特也别客气，以后有什么想要的演出服，随时和我说一声就好。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220824"
            ]
          },
          "140220824": {
            "id": "140220824",
            "speakerId": 1011,
            "speakerName": "琳妮特",
            "text": "不是演出服也行吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220825"
            ]
          },
          "140220825": {
            "id": "140220825",
            "speakerId": 1010,
            "speakerName": "林尼",
            "text": "那就多谢千织小姐了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220826"
            ]
          },
          "140220826": {
            "id": "140220826",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "娜维娅",
            "text": "我就不要什么好处了！你平时多来串串门就行。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220827"
            ]
          },
          "140220827": {
            "id": "140220827",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "绮良良",
            "text": "我也不需要什么，只要千织姐以后的跨国快递继续指名我就行。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220828"
            ]
          },
          "140220828": {
            "id": "140220828",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "娜维娅",
            "text": "哦，说到这个，绮良良你什么时候回去？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220829"
            ]
          },
          "140220829": {
            "id": "140220829",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "绮良良",
            "text": "欸！这个…我…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220830"
            ]
          },
          "140220830": {
            "id": "140220830",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "娜维娅",
            "text": "「刺玫会」专门为你准备了一辆车，可以让你坐在里面，我们推着你出枫丹哟！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220831"
            ]
          },
          "140220831": {
            "id": "140220831",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "绮良良",
            "text": "那也太丢人了吧！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220832"
            ]
          },
          "140220832": {
            "id": "140220832",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "嘿嘿，那我们有没有什么好处呢？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220833"
            ]
          },
          "140220833": {
            "id": "140220833",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "当然有，待会儿…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220834"
            ]
          },
          "140220834": {
            "id": "140220834",
            "speakerId": 1012,
            "speakerName": "夏沃蕾",
            "text": "扰乱会场秩序、私自挪用会场灯光、公众场合使用武器、危险演出不报备…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220835"
            ]
          },
          "140220835": {
            "id": "140220835",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "呃，夏沃蕾，你听我们说…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220836"
            ]
          },
          "140220836": {
            "id": "140220836",
            "speakerId": 1012,
            "speakerName": "夏沃蕾",
            "text": "…要是你们看见了我所描述的那些罪人，记得来向我这个特巡队队长汇报。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220837"
            ]
          },
          "140220837": {
            "id": "140220837",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "报罪名开心吗？吓我一跳呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220838"
            ]
          },
          "140220838": {
            "id": "140220838",
            "speakerId": 1012,
            "speakerName": "夏沃蕾",
            "text": "吓一跳的是我。会场上那出下次能提前告诉我一声吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220839"
            ]
          },
          "140220839": {
            "id": "140220839",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "告诉你你就会答应了？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220840"
            ]
          },
          "140220840": {
            "id": "140220840",
            "speakerId": 1012,
            "speakerName": "夏沃蕾",
            "text": "不会，但至少能让我不被吓到。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220841"
            ]
          },
          "140220841": {
            "id": "140220841",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "我这不是已经补偿你了吗？灰河那处生产有害商品的黑心工坊，我人都帮你捆好放在那里。还不够贴心吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220842"
            ]
          },
          "140220842": {
            "id": "140220842",
            "speakerId": 1012,
            "speakerName": "夏沃蕾",
            "text": "好吧，不和你争了。今晚我认输。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220843"
            ]
          },
          "140220843": {
            "id": "140220843",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "娜维娅",
            "text": "什么嘛，既然在这里的大家都是朋友，不如就待会儿一起去吃一顿吧！记在「刺玫会」的账上！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220844"
            ]
          },
          "140220844": {
            "id": "140220844",
            "speakerId": 1012,
            "speakerName": "夏沃蕾",
            "text": "我就免了。还有一堆手续要办，你们玩得开心。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220845"
            ]
          },
          "140220845": {
            "id": "140220845",
            "speakerId": 1012,
            "speakerName": "夏沃蕾",
            "text": "对了，千织，我路上遇到维格尔，让我给你带个话。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220846"
            ]
          },
          "140220846": {
            "id": "140220846",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "行了行了，肯定就是些道歉什么的，不用劳烦你。我改天上门去嘲笑他。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220847"
            ]
          },
          "140220847": {
            "id": "140220847",
            "speakerId": 1012,
            "speakerName": "夏沃蕾",
            "text": "你还挺了解他。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220848"
            ]
          },
          "140220848": {
            "id": "140220848",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "这次也谢谢你了，夏沃蕾。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220849"
            ]
          },
          "140220849": {
            "id": "140220849",
            "speakerId": 1012,
            "speakerName": "夏沃蕾",
            "text": "应该的。另外我再说一句——",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220850"
            ]
          },
          "140220850": {
            "id": "140220850",
            "speakerId": 1012,
            "speakerName": "夏沃蕾",
            "text": "刚才的时装秀真是漂亮极了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220851"
            ]
          },
          "140220851": {
            "id": "140220851",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "还用你说？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220852"
            ]
          },
          "140220852": {
            "id": "140220852",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "娜维娅",
            "text": "好了好了，要参加庆功宴的朝这儿看，跟我来吧！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220853"
            ]
          },
          "140220853": {
            "id": "140220853",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}，派蒙，能先到风景好的地方等我一下吗？我去和娜维娅说我们晚点到。有东西送你们。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220854"
            ]
          },
          "140220854": {
            "id": "140220854",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "风景好的地方？哦！是那里对吧，没问题！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220855"
            ]
          },
          "140220855": {
            "id": "140220855",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "嗯，我很快就来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1402209",
      "subQuestName": "前往约定的地点",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "140220901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "140220901": {
            "id": "140220901",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "久等了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220902"
            ]
          },
          "140220902": {
            "id": "140220902",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "不久不久，有什么要到这里才能送呀？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220903"
            ]
          },
          "140220903": {
            "id": "140220903",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "…来，给你这个。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220904"
            ]
          },
          "140220904": {
            "id": "140220904",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "这是…一枚胸针？还是「千织屋」的样式。咦？我也有份！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220905"
            ]
          },
          "140220905": {
            "id": "140220905",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "暂时只做了这两枚，想来想去，还是决定先送给你们。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220908"
            ]
          },
          "140220908": {
            "id": "140220908",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "这次你们帮了我很大的忙，而且几乎一直陪着我。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220909"
            ]
          },
          "140220909": {
            "id": "140220909",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "我有时候觉得，就算是为了不辜负你们的相信，我也不能认输。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220910"
            ]
          },
          "140220910": {
            "id": "140220910",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "这次更多还是千织自己的功劳啦。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220911"
            ]
          },
          "140220911": {
            "id": "140220911",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "这我敢肯定地告诉你，绝对不是。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220912"
            ]
          },
          "140220912": {
            "id": "140220912",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "在「梦想」的道路上走了这么久，我已经感受到了…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220913"
            ]
          },
          "140220913": {
            "id": "140220913",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "除了自己的信念与坚持之外，最不可或缺的，就是支持你的朋友。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220914"
            ]
          },
          "140220914": {
            "id": "140220914",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "一个人能做到的事情非常有限，这次如果不是你们相助，我可能真的会一败涂地。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220915"
            ]
          },
          "140220915": {
            "id": "140220915",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "也没有那么夸张吧…倒是我很担心千织你在时装秀上说的那些，你就不怕之后没人来买你的衣服吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220916"
            ]
          },
          "140220916": {
            "id": "140220916",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "或许我的说辞的确有些高傲，但那都是我最真诚的想法。我不会被这个世界牵着走，更别说被任何人牵着走。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220917"
            ]
          },
          "140220917": {
            "id": "140220917",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "我有自信，「千织屋」的衣服，一定是最好的那一个。好的东西，人们自然会追随。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220918"
            ]
          },
          "140220918": {
            "id": "140220918",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "嘿嘿，那我就放心了！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220919"
            ]
          },
          "140220919": {
            "id": "140220919",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "接下来，我们是不是该去参加庆功宴了呀？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220920"
            ]
          },
          "140220920": {
            "id": "140220920",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "嗯，当然。不过在那之前，再让我欣赏一下今晚的夜色吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "140220921"
            ]
          },
          "140220921": {
            "id": "140220921",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "千织",
            "text": "我敢肯定，这会是我来枫丹之后，所见过最美的一晚。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
